# Only what the weekly data job imports (fetch_all_data.py, extract_virus_data.py).
# The job runs with write access to this repository, so requirements.txt pins
# every package by version and hash: a new or hijacked release cannot slip
# into a run. Plotting dependencies live in requirements-plot.txt.
#
# Regenerate after editing:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 -o requirements.txt
